{ With no check, White can complete normal kingside development. The a6 bishop still influences decisions about c4 and the f1-a6 diagonal. } 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 b6 4. g3 Ba6 5. b3 d5 6. Bg2 Be7 7. O-O O-O 8. cxd5 exd5 9. Ne5 Bb7 10. Bb2 Nbd7 { Develop Bb2 or a knight as the position allows. Do not release the central tension without identifying the better recapture. Watch for: A capture on d5 may activate Black's pieces and surrender the space advantage. } *

