{ The queen retreats after the knight gains time. You have preserved the structure, but Black has obtained active central play. } 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nc3 Bb4 4. Qc2 d5 5. a3 Bxc3+ 6. Qxc3 Ne4 7. Qc2 O-O 8. Nf3 Nd7 9. e3 b6 10. Bd3 Bb7 { Nf3 and e3 are sensible development goals. Challenge the e4 knight only when the resulting exchanges help you. Watch for: Do not count the bishop pair as compensation for unlimited queen moves. } *

