{ White has returned material but kept central space. The queen on b6 can become a target for useful developing moves. } 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 c5 3. d5 b5 4. cxb5 a6 5. b6 Qxb6 6. Nc3 d6 7. e4 g6 8. Nf3 Bg7 9. Be2 O-O 10. Nd2 Qd8 { Develop the bishops and castle. A timely Nd2-c4 can question the queen, but verify the central tactics first. Watch for: Do not chase the queen while abandoning d5 or e4. } *

