{ White accepts material but helps Black develop a bishop. Your response must be efficient development, not further pawn collecting. } 1. d4 e5 2. dxe5 Nc6 3. Nf3 d6 4. exd6 Bxd6 5. Nc3 Nf6 6. Bg5 h6 7. Bh4 Bf5 8. e3 g5 9. Bg3 Bxg3 10. hxg3 g4 { Bg5, e3 and king safety are natural aims. Return a pawn if it removes an initiative or opens a useful line for your pieces. Watch for: A knight move to e4 can come with threats against both bishops and central squares. } *

